ejl5kGAkRq6nm5_UpxTT7XzAgaeXsMbgapkFQ&oe=69D0FB17"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot12.png", "id": "258818093420653", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974622_258818096753986_467696596536903373_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0jfnLfwJSPAQ7kNvwFqR8uM&_nc_oc=AdokABd48ERshkvoRhTofKHgFkXD8MstNZlByYgUy9F0Z8tYDEMhc5iODO5QaOel6yU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxA1I21BOGAJHzls6MOPrrcI6OLUCU9OZ2PB5PG_OkfGQ&oe=69D0F5B1"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot8.png", "id": "1501206916950409", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974791_1501206920283742_8492096938236551844_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uQa5CaGMhUwQ7kNvwGUc4wI&_nc_oc=AdqgeFeoD4w1bnJpjtR5YQiBsF_5s-FQ9Trhx7qM0p4svX1xZOJLK8JS8w_VPG6uPVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxUi8pVsN0ScIC_hjJF3YCH4omovCusonuJkMGfd_m3SQ&oe=69D10B5B"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "251261660934237", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_251261664267570_1308644332253553952_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v3RZkh6syNAQ7kNvwGTO5E0&_nc_oc=AdrRqD2jkR5gzG2abPbHxj3SnRw7PlHUHUeQxIzuqMmoXZVLcXwJRSMTSiM8C_WTbw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz7n2-L1nSWZHEaLFojcELXLZ9R4TPefieqTUxj7842iQ&oe=69D11D1E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1674681809669861", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1674681813003194_2895250008313765539_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z5hTnqNUBB0Q7kNvwF_xO7i&_nc_oc=Ado2VXPMyYkvTw2w6lPTGx9YG2Dvfp0DCT9gypDxKkOKHpyDullkCaEBKpp5YHLKyrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxPCtxJXnS4KoF3jFtTkXytUfLeBucGXSklIfv5c0e6Ew&oe=69D10B54"}, "display_name": "The Master Club", "keywords": ["Chess", "Ludo", "Domino", "Checkers", "Rubiks"], "long_description": "Join the Discord community to find other players to play online with:\nhttps://discord.gg/W4KMzaqsas\n\nThe Master Club is a collection of casual games which includes:\n- Air Hockey\n- Archery\n- Basketball\n- Bowling\n- Checkers\n- Chess\n- Football Table\n- Mini Golf\n- Pool Billiard\n- Rubiks Cube 2x2\n- Rubiks Cube 3x3\n- Solitaire\n- Table Tennis\n- Tennis\n- Tic Tac Toe\n- Pistol shooting\n- Chinese Checkers\n- Ludo\n- Backgammon\n- Draw Domino\n\nThis game contains the following features:\n- Single Player mode with 4 levels of difficulty (Easy, Medium, Hard, Master)\n- Multiplayer mode with an internal matchmaking system\n- 60 Achievements to unlock\n- Leaderboards to see your ranking compared to other players\n- Voice chat to talk with your opponent on multiplayer mode\n- Avatar selection\n\nThe game contains the following scenarios:\n- Day Outdoor\n- Night Outdoor\n- Hotel\n- Room\n- Bar\n\nWalk around the scenario using the Thumbstick buttons,\nmove up and down using the Thumbstick buttons,\nthis game uses snap turn to reduce potential motion sickness,\nChess game offers 4 different styles of pieces,\nCheckers game offers 2 different styles of pieces,\nPool game offers 3 different styles of tables,\nRubik's Cube 2x2 and 3x3 contain auto solver\nthat can be stopped at any moment.", "short_description": "Play:\n- Air Hockey\n- Archery\n- Basketball\n- Bowling\n- Checkers\n- Chess\n- Football Table\n- Mini Golf\n- Pool Billiard\n- Rubiks Cube 2x2\n- Rubiks Cube 3x3\n- Solitaire\n- Table Tennis\n- Tennis\n- Tic Tac Toe\n- Pistol shooting\n- Chinese Checkers\n- Ludo\n- Backgammon\n- Draw Domino\n\nOn 5 different scenarios:\n- Day Outdoor\n- Night Outdoor\n- Hotel\n- Room\n- Bar"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-updated-at-2021-09-17.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-ar